WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Episodio 12

2
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.200
Señorita Curtis,

3
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:13.500
tomar una copa.

4
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:15.460
Sr. Morgen,

5
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.200
No bebo.

6
